## Installing

| Artifact | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `tpt-shell-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip` | Windows, portable, or through winget and Scoop |
| `tpt-shell-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz`, `tpt-shell-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz` | macOS, or through Homebrew |
| `tpt-shell-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz` | Linux |
| `SHA256SUMS` | Checksums for every artifact |
| `release-attestation.json`, `*.minisig` | Release record and signatures, when present |
| `compliance/` | SBOMs (CycloneDX 1.5, SPDX 2.3), attestation.json, licence notices |

Check a download with `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS`, then `minisign -V` with the public key when a
`.minisig` file is supplied.

